# {{ s.name }} — the domain model and the legal moves

Variant: `{{ variant }}`

`rules` tells the player what to do. This is what makes doing it work: where
every piece is, whether a move is legal, and — when it is not — why not.

It spawns nothing. `EntitySpawner` has already built one object per entity
instance under a group named after the entity, so this **adopts** them: the
icons and cards are pieces, the panels are zones.

